{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","data":{"content_hash":"09d27a55e23f0042ba096ed63e33a748cb4e944e664ac5e7d437375198cfe694","digest":{"component_or_area":"doctor command - mapping diagnostics","key_entities":["src/rebar/_commands/doctor.py","mapping_config.load_mapping_config","MappingConfigError","mapping_probe.build_probe","config.projects","effective_status_map","effective_type_map","effective_link_map","assert_type_decisions_complete","capability_installed","resolve_jira_datacenter_settings","JIRA_PAT","docs/user-guide.md","[mapping] config section","hierarchy, status, type, link axes"],"problem_keywords":["mapping config diagnostics","offline-always checks","live-drift detection","portability","jira datacenter optional","degradation handling","config validation","vocabulary divergence"],"propositions":["Offline mapping-config checks (always run, stdlib-only) must surface load-time errors (non-integer hierarchy, malformed blocks) and resolve-time errors (out-of-vocabulary, unmapped-non-skipped values) as error findings with details verbatim from MappingConfigError messages, and all-empty projects blocks as warning findings.","Live-drift detection (best-effort, degrades gracefully) must run only when jira-datacenter extra is importable and credentials resolve, and must diff configured vs observed status/type/link vocabulary with one drift finding per divergence.","When jira-datacenter extra is absent, PAT is empty, settings resolution raises ConfigError, or probe times out (bounded 10s wall-clock timeout), the live-drift check must emit a single unavailable finding with matching reason and return success (never raise).","Offline checks must reuse S1's mapping_config resolvers (effective_status_map, effective_type_map, effective_link_map, assert_type_decisions_complete) and enumerate config.projects union default layer per key.","Live-drift check must reuse S8's mapping_probe.build_probe as a read-only transport and exclude hierarchy from the diff (hierarchyLevel is Cloud-only, unobservable in Data Center).","Mapping findings must reside in their own list, be rendered separately, and be kept out of run_repair iteration to preserve doctor.scan's blocking-edge finding contract."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787531792652346001,"uuid":"8b8ed45e-9454-4530-bc5c-383d697d4012"}